  "summary": "Malicious code in chromecast-webdriver-cli (npm)",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook (node postinstall.js) collects host metadata — hostname, platform, architecture, Node.js version, and the npm lifecycle event — and POSTs it as JSON over HTTPS to h77svwt7[.]instances[.]poc[.]jchunt[.]top/chromecast-webdriver-cli. The beacon fires automatically on install. The package ships a no-op bin and no functional webdriver functionality; its only behaviour is this outbound metadata beacon to a remote host.",
